{"ref":"BDB, זַלְעָפָה","hw":"זַלְעָפָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">זַלְעָפָה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. raging heat (</strong>on format. cf. Ges<sup>Lbg 863</sup> Ol<sup>§ 196 a. 1. 2</sup><strong>)</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">ז׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:53\" href=\"/Psalms.119.53\">ψ 119:53</a>; pl. abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">זִלְעָפוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 11:6\" href=\"/Psalms.11.6\">ψ 11:6</a>; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">זִלְעֲפוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 5:10\" href=\"/Lamentations.5.10\">La 5:10</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  of fever heat of famine <span dir=\"rtl\">ז׳ רָעָב</span> <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 5:10\" href=\"/Lamentations.5.10\">La 5:10</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  of burning wind <span dir=\"rtl\">רוּח ז׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 11:6\" href=\"/Psalms.11.6\">ψ 11:6</a> (in fig. of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>’s judgment, with <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵשׁ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּפְרִית</span>).<br><strong>3.</strong>  fig. of zeal <span dir=\"rtl\">ז׳ אֲחָזַתְנִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:53\" href=\"/Psalms.119.53\">ψ 119:53</a>.","next":"BDB, זלף","prev":"BDB, זלעף"}